# Raucous Entertainer: "each creature you control". Bot1 keeps its Entertainer untapped on turn 3; on turn 4 Bot2's Memnite enters and Bot1
# pays {1} with Mox Emerald: Bot2's Memnite, which did enter this turn, gets no counter (1/1), and neither does Bot1's older Memnite, with nothing
# new on its side (1/1); the Entertainer, a creature that entered on turn 1, stays 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Raucous Entertainer
Memnite
Plains x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Raucous Entertainer.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Raucous Entertainer.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Raucous Entertainer.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Raucous Entertainer.Tapped = true
